### 前置说明
# GET 请求参数通过 query string 传递，统一由 @Validated 校验。

### get-conversation
GET {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/agent/get-conversation?userId=user_123&conversationId=conv_20260826000001

### get-conversation 参数缺失（触发 @Validated 校验）
GET {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/agent/get-conversation?userId=user_123

### list-conversations
GET {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/agent/list-conversations?userId=user_123&page=1&size=20

### list-conversations 缺省分页
GET {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/agent/list-conversations?userId=user_123

### list-conversations 参数非法（page=0 触发 @Validated 校验）
GET {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/agent/list-conversations?userId=user_123&page=0&size=20
